# Local DB snapshots — hundreds of MB, machine-specific, regenerable.
# Restore procedure is documented in HERMES-MC-BRIDGE.md ("Backups").
backups/

# Sync watermark: session ids + timestamps, regenerated on every run.
hermes_mc_sync_state.json

# The root .gitignore has a bare `*.cmd` rule aimed at kernel-module build
# artifacts. This wrapper is a real script (Task Scheduler entry point), so
# re-include it explicitly.
!hermes_mc_sync.cmd
